  }]], "3ColumnTableMod",
 GridBoxOptions->{
 GridBoxBackground->{"Columns" -> {{None}}, "Rows" -> {None, {None}}},
 GridBoxDividers->{"Rows" -> {{True, True, True}}}},
 CellID->669448393,ExpressionUUID->"c92df638-a5b1-4150-9788-dff5f963a84c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The matrix is partitioned into ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"2", "\[Times]", "2"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "53cc0327-8e2c-4e01-8697-b5914a12f50a"],
 " blocks. In each step, a pivot block pair ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{"p", ",", "q"}], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "83d24a36-ccdc-4539-b545-7b09fb48ff02"],
 " is annihilated by a generalized Jacobi rotation: the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"4", "\[Times]", "4"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b507429e-2dc6-47a0-9372-da35aefc2703"],
 " submatrix built from blocks ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{"p", ",", "p"}], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "03187896-906a-497d-bb92-cd2c06890647"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{"p", ",", "q"}], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "910abf47-6f19-4db0-9be9-62c4bc8f3645"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{"q", ",", "p"}], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "09604759-908c-4e53-87cb-24b16a63586e"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{"q", ",", "q"}], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ed2b884c-04a6-4dcf-b634-b2587ec47eef"],
 " is brought to normal form by two complex Householder reflections \
(tridiagonalization, Eq. (63) of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["Humeniuk and Mitric (2018)"]], 
    "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cpc.2018.04.026"},
   "WebLink",
   BaseStyle->{"Notes"}]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e7e95b47-dc1b-4b8b-bc57-9106482a55cc"],
 ", a permutation, a complex Jacobi rotation whose tangents solve the coupled \
quadratics Eqs. (78)-(81), and a final complex scaling, Eq. (92). Pivots are \
skipped when the block norm falls below the dynamic threshold of Eq. (42). \
Each rotation strictly decreases the off-diagonal norm ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[Tau]", 
    RowBox[{"(", "A", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "bc859e78-7326-483b-95af-d9dca2991678"],
 ", Eq. (39), which guarantees convergence. The expected cost scales as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["n", "3"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "48d7db92-ee90-4a6d-84db-1c176480298d"],
 ", as for standard Jacobi diagonalization or SVD."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1250076786,ExpressionUUID->"254d7022-1ae9-4b96-aee4-e62400342b86"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Input should be a machine-precision numeric matrix; exact or symbolic input \
is numericized with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["N"]], "paclet:ref/N"},
   "RefLink",
   BaseStyle->{"InlineFormula"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "2b1df0b4-a779-4886-bc3e-7a5bc447f6d6"],
 " on entry. Skew-symmetry is checked with a relative tolerance of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["10", 
    RowBox[{"-", "12"}]], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "fdea95cc-252a-4cdf-b505-48e1b5cbdb45"],
 " and dimension must be even. The reduced singular values are returned in \
diagonal order, not sorted. If higher working precision is desired, the \
internal tolerances (\"Tolerance\" option) should be tightened along with the \
precision of the input."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1609718929,ExpressionUUID->"af189d29-03cf-4ad2-9838-b82e8ca76ebc"],

Cell["\<\
Skew-symmetric matrices arise as the phase-space metric in the time-dependent \
variational principle (TDVP). When the metric becomes singular due to \
parameter redundancies, the equations of motion must be solved in a \
least-square sense; discarding small singular values in pairs (rather than \
one at a time, as a generic SVD solver may do for numerically degenerate \
values) keeps the pseudoinverse skew-symmetric and preserves the symplectic \
structure.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1895914564,ExpressionUUID->"4f5226df-c7ce-416e-9a91-1b2980113551"]
}, Closed]],

